   "ObjectType" -> "Symbol", "Usage" -> 
    "CardiacSegmentGUI[data, mask, vox] allows to segment the heart in 1, 4, \
6 or AHA-17 segements for each slice 360 radial samples are generated.\n\n\
data is a background image on which all overlays are projected. \nmask is the \
mask of the left ventricle (same as used for CentralAxes) and defines the \
area in which the data is sampled.\noff is the centerpoints generated by \
CentralAxes.\n\nOutput is {points, slices , {rev, flip}}.", 
