are registered seperately.\nRegisterDiffusionDataSplit[{dtidata, dtimask, \
vox}, {anatdata, anatmask, voxa}] is identical to Register diffusion data \
however left and right side of the data are registered seperately.\n\n\
Splitting the data is done using the function CutData and merged wit Stich \
data.\nOutput is the registered data.", 
