distribution. Uses ParameterFit.\\nHist[data, range, label] plots a \
probability density histogram of the data from xmin to xmax with a fitted \
(skew)normal distribution and label as x-axis label.\\nHist[{data1.., \
data2,..}, {range1, range2,..}] plots a probability density histogram of the \
