aplies a linebroadening with linewidth gam and a custom lineshape f to the \
fid (f=0, \\\"Gaussinan\\\", f=1 \\\"Lorentzian\\\").\\nTTimeShiftEcho[fid, \
time, gyro, {gam, eps}] aplies a linebroadening with linewidth gam to the fid \
and a phase eps that results in eps ppm shift of the spectra. The gyro can be \
obtained with GetGyro.\\nTTimeShiftEcho[fid, time, gyro, {gam, eps, f}] \
